# Repos a reviewer of THIS repo may search and cite, materialized under
# .siblings/<owner>/<repo>. Declared rather than left to the fallback so
# the set is the one this repo actually depends on.
#
# One per line. The reviewer host must also carry a SOURCE_PATHS entry for
# each, or the sibling reports as `missing` and is never searched.
#
# Each row is a real edge: `tkmx-server` is the tokenmaxxing server that
# reporter/ still posts to by default (SERVER_URL); `agent-index-server` is
# the index standalone/agent_index_client.py registers agents and reports
# usage to (INDEX_ORIGIN); and `plow` owns the Plow API that client calls
# for identity (PLOW_API_BASE, /v1/auth/index-identity).

plow-pbc/tkmx-server
plow-pbc/agent-index-server
plow-pbc/plow
